Inside

the Castle</b>

3
00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:41.460
<b>A Kunoichi's Oath</b>

4
00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:38.330
It's Straw Hat and Jinbe

5
00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:41.500
They're strong!
Crazy strong! Watch out

6
00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:44.840
The hell am I, chopped liver

7
00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:46.010
Hurry, okay

8
00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:47.340
I am hurrying

9
00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.260
I wanna get up there and
kick Kaido's ass already

10
00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.770
You guys really
aren't worth a damn

11
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.230
I'm sorry,
General Fourtricks

12
00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:03.590
General Hamlet

13
00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:04.570
General Hamlet!

14
00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:07.700
We gave it our best,
but it wasn't enough

15
00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:08.400
A word comes to mind
when I think of you

16
00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.860
There's a word
that comes to mind,

17
00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:09.890
and that word is "failure."

18
00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:12.180
and that word is "common"

19
00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.020
As for us?
"Exceptional, " of course

20
00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:20.820
Beyond expectations

21
00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:18.830
<b>Headliner Hamlet

Beast Pirates

Giraffe Smile Fruit</b>

22
00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.360
The strong keep
their mouths shut, Hamlet

23
00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:26.240
They let their actions
speak for them

24
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.210
<b>Headliner Fourtricks

Beast Pirates

Chicken Smile Fruit</b>

25
00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.380
You may begin. I'm ready

26
00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:23.830
We must continue. Can you stand

27
00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.950
Of course I can

28
00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:38.630
That's just what
I'd expect of you

29
00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.740
Your courage never
seems to run out

30
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:47.530
You know,
you samurai impress me

31
00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:49.440
Just like Roger. And Whitebeard

32
00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:51.910
They knew
what it meant to be bold

33
00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:56.830
That's why their legends
will be passed on for ages

34
00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:07.550
Both their stories
had proper endings

35
00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:08.780
Perhaps it's old fashioned

36
00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.100
Perhaps it's old fashioned,

37
00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:10.110
but I believe death
completes a man

38
00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:11.280
but I believe death
completes a man.

39
00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:16.640
I'm sure you must feel the same

40
00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:20.110
So why don't we finish this

41
00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:22.030
Don't be so arrogant,
you monster!

42
00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.490
Don't be so arrogant

43
00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:25.640
You monster

44
00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:25.790
Do you think getting killed
by you would be an honor?

45
00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:30.370
Do you think getting killed
by you would be an honor

46
00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.760
Never!

47
00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:56.720
It's me, your buddy!

48
00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:59.890
Wouldn't you rather
bite a samurai?

49
00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:03.350
Master Queen!
Why are you doing this to us?

50
00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:11.360
My body. Oh no.
It's all over me!

51
00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.270
Get him off me!

52
00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.340
are all failures

53
00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.920
and all you can do is laugh

54
00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.380
Now you can be useful,
just this once

55
00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.860
Somebody help

56
00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.580
Poor man asked you for help
and you just cut him down

57
00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.710
That was the only way
I could help him

58
00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:36.080
He was becoming an oni

59
00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.460
I suppose you're right

60
00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.800
Well, that aside.
Has anyone seen the captain

61
00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.010
He'll be fine

62
00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:46.800
Wherever he is,
I bet we've got it worse

63
00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.930
No mercy even for their allies

64
00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:56.240
Damn it. I'm sorry.

65
00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:59.240
I got sloppy back there, Boss.

66
00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:03.460
Now I must do the honorable
thing and protect my friends.

67
00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:06.540
Don't be hasty, you damn fool!

68
00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:12.170
I don't wanna be an oni!

69
00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:14.500
We can find a cure. I know it!

70
00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.160
If there's nothing
left for us to try,

71
00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.810
then and only then
shall I finish you.

72
00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.440
Don't sacrifice yourself!

73
00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.730
We're losing ground.

74
00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.400
There has to be
something we can do!

75
00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:25.770
Tell us, Chopper!

76
00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:29.250
One problem.
I can't fight and make medicine.

77
00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.830
Also, we'll have to
administer shots to all the oni,

78
00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.210
and that won't be easy.

79
00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.270
So, uh...

80
00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:37.610
This is tough, but we do
have one thing on our side.

81
00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.420
Unlike in Udon,
the virus-creator's here.

82
00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:42.210
There's no way
he would design something

83
00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:44.710
so deadly and not
make an antibody.

84
00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:46.380
He must have it somewhere.

85
00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.680
It's the best chance
we've got right now.

86
00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:51.550
If we get that,
I can make medicine, easy.

87
00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:54.010
I don't think that
"easy" is the word.

88
00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:56.930
We'll have to take the cure
from a Lead Performer.

89
00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.880
With medicine,
I should be able to

90
00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.710
make the symptoms go away,

91
00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.260
but they might be in
bad shape after that.

92
00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.180
They gained incredible
strength when they transformed,

93
00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:25.850
but their skin was
exposed to extreme cold.

94
00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.430
That's too much strain.

95
00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:29.770
I'm afraid their bodies
can't handle it!

96
00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:35.190
Damn, these guys
get back up in no time.

97
00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.650
Almost like they're zombies!

98
00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:42.390
No. If we aren't able to get
that cure, those people...

99
00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.600
...will die.

100
00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:48.270
Once you get infected,

101
00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:51.980
you'll have an hour to live,
if you're lucky!

102
00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:52.460
That can't be!

103
00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:56.000
Those Ice Oni down there
are your friends, right?

104
00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:01.130
Your bosses?
Your "brothers in arms"?

105
00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:04.140
Right now, they're giving it
all they've got!

106
00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.850
This is a big moment for them!

107
00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:11.350
Give 'em one last hug to
show 'em how much you care!

108
00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:13.360
Then you'll be next.

109
00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.820
You damn sicko!

110
00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:22.240
How many of these freaky
viruses you gotta make

111
00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.900
before you're happy?

112
00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:26.700
Screw this floor!
I'm outta here!

113
00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:33.000
Hey. Open the damn door!

114
00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.980
Huh? Hey! It's Brother Apoo!

115
00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:38.360
Huh?

116
00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:43.120
What is this stuff?

117
00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:49.030
That is the only vial
of antibody for the virus.

118
00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:51.700
Uh, and he gave it to me?

119
00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:55.540
Lose it and
I'll kill you, you dig?

120
00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:56.950
Uh, what?

121
00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.460
An antibody?

122
00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:00.080
And he has it?

123
00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.160
There's an antibody?

124
00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.410
Then there's hope!

125
00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:10.840
Queen presents

126
00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:15.180
"Game Time," baby!

127
00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.020
♪ Zoomin', zoomin',
zoomin', zoomin'. ♪

128
00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.900
♪ Let's party hearty, buddy,
'cause it's time to play! ♪

129
00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.280
♪ You wanna win the game? ♪

130
00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.900
♪ You'll make that sucka pay! ♪

131
00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:40.620
♪ Murder. Betrayal.
I ain't gonna lie. ♪

132
00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:45.450
♪ 'Cause in an hour, sucka,
you are gonna die! ♪

133
00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.910
It's pandemonium!

134
00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.160
How could you?

135
00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:51.010
These are people's lives
you're playing with!

136
00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:57.970
Ice Oni Tag!
You better hurry, boy!

137
00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:01.450
Son of a... Come on!

138
00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:04.970
Zoro! Get that vial
and bring it back to me!

139
00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:06.120
Got it!

140
00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.710
Don't let them have it!

141
00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.330
Our people will die!

142
00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:12.520
Don't let the samurai
get the cure!

143
00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:19.560
Queen, c'mon, buddy!
This is too much, even for you!

144
00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:22.580
Time starts now!

145
00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:29.400
Better hurry. Run or die!

146
00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.740
If they don't catch you,
then you win, brother!

147
00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:34.780
But everyone else
will kick the bucket!

148
00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:51.320
<b>Right-Brain Tower

Inside the Dome</b>

149
00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:53.290
You seriously wanna
fight for the Kozuki?

150
00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:56.750
Or maybe you'd rather carry them
on your back and run away?

151
00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:03.760
Well, whatever.
We don't have to beat you.

152
00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:06.380
Our only mission is
to kill the boy.

153
00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:10.120
Don't listen to him.
I'll keep you safe, I swear.

154
00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.250
You're risking your life?

155
00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:15.130
For me? For the Kozuki?

156
00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.090
Whoever you are,
it doesn't matter now.

157
00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.010
If you'll help us...

158
00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:27.100
Please save our
young lord, I beg you.

159
00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.930
I'll save him, Shinobu.
You as well!

160
00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.640
What?

161
00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:38.060
Twenty years ago,
I saw Kozuki Oden's execution.

162
00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:00.460
You live in peace,
and none of you know why!

163
00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:03.600
Who the hell do you
think ensured that?

164
00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:07.860
The entire time, Lord Oden
has been protecting Wano.

165
00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:13.490
The entire time, Lord Oden
has been protecting Wano!

166
00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:13.530
So why don't you tell me again!

167
00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:15.820
So why don't you tell me again?

168
00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:18.700
Who are you calling a fool?!

169
00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:22.960
The speech you gave that day
brought me to tears!

170
00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:34.630
More than that, Kozuki Oden's
way of life has inspired me.

171
00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:02.730
On that terrible day,
I had hoped to save you.

172
00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.400
So I ran to Kuri.

173
00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:10.400
W-Wait, you're okay?

174
00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:14.490
But in the end, all I
could do was watch, powerless,

175
00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:17.830
as Kaido held you over
the edge of the castle.

176
00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.500
I'm sorry I failed you.

177
00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.630
Hm?

178
00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.760
I was weak.

179
00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:38.970
But not now! Not anymore!

180
00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.360
Huh?

181
00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:03.930
Who are you,
really? Tell me!

182
00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:04.620
Kozuki Oden.

183
00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:04.670
You said that
you were my father

184
00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.960
You said
that you were my father

185
00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:07.480
Kozuki Oden. But...

186
00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:10.710
But I have another name.

187
00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.420
I have another name.

188
00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.220
Yamato!

189
00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:30.150
And I shall
lay down my life for you!

190
00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.630
Damn you, Marco!

191
00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.760
I don't know my role
in this story yet,

192
00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:39.920
but I do know you're bad news.

193
00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.970
You're the last thing
Straw Hat and his allies

194
00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:43.930
need to deal with right now!

195
00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.100
Ha.

196
00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:52.650
Hey! C'mere, Prometheus!

197
00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:53.770
Yes, Mama!

198
00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:59.570
You ready?
Heavenly Fire!

199
00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.390
Ships are sailing to a new era,

200
00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:07.810
but there's no room
on them for you!

201
00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.690
Oh, shut up!

202
00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:21.660
Why is his
flame stronger than mine?

203
00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.360
Prometheus, no!

204
00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:32.540
Phoenix fire is a rare breed.

205
00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.420
Don't know what
to tell you, bro!

206
00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:39.740
You think you're cute, huh?
I'll show you!

207
00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:41.620
I've got you now, bird-brain!

208
00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:44.420
I've got you now, bird-brain.

209
00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.880
Should've minded
your own business!

210
00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:46.960
Now, Perospero! Shoot him down!

211
00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:50.420
Now, Perospero. Shoot him down!

212
00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.590
Ready, Mama!

213
00:16:57.060 --> 00:17:03.200
I do apologize,
dear Marco.

214
00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:08.180
Our lickity-alliance
was short-lived.

215
00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:10.600
Well, this sucks.

216
00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:14.390
I once longed to kill you,
but now it's just a formality.

217
00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:16.600
Oh, how ironic.

218
00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:47.810
You! You're the one
who attacked us last time!

219
00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:52.580
So you're here
to thwart me again, are you?

220
00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:56.420
Is this the man? Pedro's killer?

221
00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:59.420
It's all his fault.
He deserves to suffer.

222
00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:03.050
Don't blame me.
That idiot blew himself up!

223
00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:06.290
It's like he's harassing me
from the damn afterlife!

224
00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.920
This is my path.

225
00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:12.300
This is the road that Pedro
set out for me and my friends.

226
00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.770
What a pain in the ass!

227
00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:28.020
I don't need to deal with
your petty revenge right now.

228
00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.570
Couldn't they do it
on their own time?

229
00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:33.530
We are trying to
fight a war here!

230
00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.580
Have it your way.

231
00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.960
Sorry, who're you?

232
00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:49.000
My name is Carrot. That's Wanda.

233
00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.170
And you-teia are Marco.

234
00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:54.550
A friend of Master Cat Viper,
from what I've heard.

235
00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:56.260
I suppose you could say that.

236
00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.430
Bye-bye, birdie!

237
00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:01.930
If you still wanna kill me,
come back some other time!

238
00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:06.860
I can't afford to waste
any of my soul to beat you!

239
00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:10.150
Follow her, Marco!
Leave him to us!

240
00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:13.200
'Kay! I'm counting on you two!

241
00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:32.320
Gimme that vial!

242
00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:37.120
Leave me alone, already!

243
00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:47.920
Stop, stop! Yo!

244
00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:52.300
Two against one
ain't fair, you cheaters!

245
00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:56.190
Damn it!

246
00:19:57.530 --> 00:20:00.900
Why don't you give up
so I can help Kin'emon fight?

247
00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:03.410
Drake, this loser's
wasting my time!

248
00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:04.620
Let's finish this!

249
00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:09.540
That's fine with me.
I've always hated him!

250
00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:11.960
I don't care! I hate you, too!

251
00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:16.050
That's a real
dick move, Drake.

252
00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:22.680
Spying wasn't enough, so you
gotta be a straight-up traitor?

253
00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:27.180
I see.
That's Roronoa Zoro.

254
00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:29.980
The Straw Hats have a couple
of big-shots in the crew.

255
00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.100
We had better take them down

256
00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:33.560
before they cause
any more trouble.

257
00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:36.940
Wait. That's Judge's son.

258
00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:38.290
He's with Straw Hat?

259
00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.240
His family is the face
of Germa 66.

260
00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:45.280
And one of them
is here? Interesting.

261
00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:49.010
Oh, wait. As it
turns out, I'm fine.

262
00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:53.270
I mean, look at me.
No horns. Nothing!

263
00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:55.940
What a relief!

264
00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:59.190
Your body temperature can't go
down, 'cause you're all bones!

265
00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.610
You're cold as a corpse already!

266
00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:04.940
I see! That makes sense. Yes.

267
00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:09.160
Why, I don't have any flesh
or organs for that matter, do I?

268
00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:12.790
Even a fatal illness
is no threat to a corpse! Heh...

269
00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:18.250
Wow,
that is depressing.

270
00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.790
But I'm invincible!

271
00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:23.710
Wait a sec.
Brook is a skeleton,

272
00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:27.260
so his temperature didn't
change when he was infected.

273
00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:29.840
Also, the ice didn't spread.

274
00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:32.720
That means the virus must be
spreading through the ice.

275
00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.520
It's multiplying.

276
00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:37.560
It happens because
their body gets cold.

277
00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:41.560
So then, we have to
maintain their temperature.

278
00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:43.780
All right, but how is it

279
00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:46.740
freezing their body
from the inside?

280
00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:50.830
Maybe I was wrong
about how it works.

281
00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:51.780
Chopper, your arm!
What's happening?

282
00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:55.040
Chopper. Your arm.
What's happening?

283
00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:59.060
How did I not notice?

284
00:21:59.060 --> 00:21:59.060
Oh no! When did they get me?

285
00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:01.310
Oh, no! When did they get me?

286
00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:01.400
Chopper is gonna die!

287
00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:05.030
All is lost!

288
00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:07.860
Chopper's gonna die!

289
00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:13.350
Special Attack:
Green Star! Devil!

290
00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:22.150
Ew! Ew, gross!

291
00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:24.030
Gotcha! Hell yeah!

292
00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:25.360
"If you can't beat 'em,

293
00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:28.530
dissolve 'em with
digestive fluid," I always say!

294
00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:35.370
This stuff is nasty
and sticky, and I hate it!

295
00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:37.670
Help me, Pay-Pay!

296
00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:41.500
Pay-Pay!

297
00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:47.930
You could've
freed yourself, you whiner.

298
00:22:47.930 --> 00:22:51.100
No fair!

299
00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:57.270
Aww, Pay-Pay,
you're my hero!

300
00:22:59.360 --> 00:23:02.650
You're covered
in slime, you maniac!

301
00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:06.360
No fair! Let's try this one!

302
00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:10.580
Huh?

303
00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:13.040
Bamboo Javelin!

304
00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:21.290
That attack was so basic.

305
00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.220
No more games.

306
00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:34.470
Because I am
done playing around!

307
00:23:44.820 --> 00:23:46.650
Ulti-Mortar!

308
00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:48.450
Not again.

309
00:23:56.360 --> 00:23:58.450
Hold on, Usopp.

310
00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:04.950
You're next, tramp!

311
00:24:04.950 --> 00:24:07.790
Don't kill me!

312
00:24:07.790 --> 00:24:09.880
I can't fight back! It's over!

313
00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:11.540
You beat me. You won this!

314
00:24:11.540 --> 00:24:13.380
You totally defeated me!

315
00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:15.460
You think I don't
know that already?

316
00:24:15.460 --> 00:24:18.260
You've wasted enough of my time.

317
00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:19.760
Now, say it!

318
00:24:19.760 --> 00:24:22.600
Okay! What do I say?

319
00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:25.390
I told you
loud and clear, didn't I?

320
00:24:25.390 --> 00:24:27.390
Your captain pissed me off,

321
00:24:27.390 --> 00:24:30.060
bragging about how he's
gonna beat Commander Kaido

322
00:24:30.060 --> 00:24:32.020
and be King of the Pirates!

323
00:24:33.110 --> 00:24:35.110
I'm sorry, you're right!

324
00:24:35.110 --> 00:24:39.200
Luffy's an idiot!
And he talks too much!

325
00:24:39.200 --> 00:24:42.490
Just don't headbutt me,
I'm begging you!

326
00:24:42.490 --> 00:24:44.040
I'll do anything!

327
00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:45.750
I'll leave the island!

328
00:24:45.750 --> 00:24:50.250
If you hit me again,
I'm done. I'll die.

329
00:24:50.250 --> 00:24:53.130
Then I'll give you
one last chance!

330
00:24:53.130 --> 00:24:55.260
Sat it, loud and clear!

331
00:24:55.260 --> 00:24:58.760
Say that your captain will
never be King of the Pirates!

332
00:24:58.760 --> 00:25:04.970
Fine.

333
00:25:06.390 --> 00:25:09.520
Luffy will...

334
00:25:16.070 --> 00:25:16.540
Luffy will... He'll never...

335
00:25:16.540 --> 00:25:17.790
will!

336
00:25:17.790 --> 00:25:22.040
Luffy will never be able to...

337
00:25:22.040 --> 00:25:26.380
That's it, Nami.
It's okay to lie.

338
00:25:26.380 --> 00:25:29.050
The truth isn't worth dying for!

339
00:25:29.050 --> 00:25:32.220
Not after we've come this far!

340
00:25:32.220 --> 00:25:36.350
Just lie to her!
Whatever it takes!

341
00:25:37.650 --> 00:25:43.490
Luffy will...
Luffy will never...

342
00:25:45.020 --> 00:25:49.530
...never give up till he wins!

343
00:25:53.030 --> 00:25:55.700
So, I'm sorry.

344
00:25:55.700 --> 00:26:01.250
He'll beat Kaido, and he'll
become King of the Pirates!

345
00:26:04.080 --> 00:26:08.010
You had
your chance. Now, die.

346
00:26:10.010 --> 00:26:12.430
Get away, Nami,
you dope! Hurry!

347
00:26:12.430 --> 00:26:14.550
Onami!

348
00:26:18.020 --> 00:26:21.640
Go, Komachiyo! Sic her!

349
00:26:27.190 --> 00:26:28.400
A dog?

350
00:26:34.120 --> 00:26:36.330
Huh? Is that...

351
00:26:36.330 --> 00:26:40.290
It's Otama!
What are you doing here?
